---
import Brand from '../components/Brand.astro';
import GitHubIcon from '../components/GitHubIcon.astro';
import ExternalLinkIcon from '../components/ExternalLinkIcon.astro';
import ArrowRightIcon from '../components/ArrowRightIcon.astro';
import '../styles/landing.css';
import '../styles/support.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#121110" />
    <title>Get in touch | aven</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Get help with Aven, find setup and recovery guides, report a public issue, or email the developer." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://aventasks.dev/support/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/space-grotesk-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Get in touch | aven" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Guides, bug reports, and ways to get in touch with Aven’s developer." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://aventasks.dev/support/" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="container">
      <header class="site-header">
        <Brand />
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a class="features-link" href="/#features">Features</a>
          <a href="/sync/">Sync</a>
          <a href="/mobile/">Mobile</a>
          <a href="/getting-started/">Docs</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/raine/aven"><GitHubIcon /> GitHub</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main id="main" class="support-page">
        <header class="support-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Help with Aven</p>
          <h1>Get in touch</h1>
          <p class="support-intro">Found a bug or have a question? Open a GitHub issue or send an email.</p>
        </header>

        <section class="support-options" aria-label="Contact options">
          <article class="support-card">
            <p class="support-card-label">Public</p>
            <h2>Report an issue</h2>
            <p>Use GitHub Issues for bugs, feature requests, and questions that can be discussed in public.</p>
            <a class="support-action" href="https://github.com/raine/aven/issues">
              Open GitHub Issues
              <ExternalLinkIcon />
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="support-card">
            <p class="support-card-label">Private</p>
            <h2>Email me</h2>
            <p>For anything you’d rather not post publicly, send me an email.</p>
            <a class="support-action" href="mailto:raine@zendit.fi">
              raine@zendit.fi
              <ArrowRightIcon />
            </a>
          </article>
        </section>

        <section class="support-section" aria-labelledby="guides-heading">
          <div class="support-section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
            <h2 id="guides-heading">Guides for common needs</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="support-guides">
            <a href="/getting-started/">
              <span><strong>Getting started</strong><small>Install Aven and create your first task.</small></span>
              <ArrowRightIcon />
            </a>
            <a href="/sync/setup/">
              <span><strong>Sync across devices</strong><small>Configure and troubleshoot your own sync server.</small></span>
              <ArrowRightIcon />
            </a>
            <a href="/backups/">
              <span><strong>Back up and restore</strong><small>Protect your data and recover from a backup.</small></span>
              <ArrowRightIcon />
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="support-section support-notes" aria-labelledby="crash-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Optional diagnostics</p>
            <h2 id="crash-heading">Share a crash report manually</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="support-note-copy">
            <p>Zendit Oy does not retrieve, view, export, query, or use Aven reports from Apple's crash feeds, App Analytics, MetricKit, or related APIs. Apple may collect diagnostics under its own policy, and Aven does not provide an app-side switch to disable that collection. If you choose to help investigate an iPhone crash, locate the relevant <code>.ips</code> file and send it through <a href="mailto:raine@zendit.fi">email</a>.</p>
            <p>Only send a report voluntarily when you are comfortable sharing it. Do not post crash reports in public GitHub Issues.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="support-section support-notes" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Reporting a bug</p>
            <h2 id="contact-heading">What happened?</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="support-note-copy">
            <p>Include the Aven version, your operating system or device, what you expected, what happened, and steps that reproduce the problem. Exact error text is useful when it does not contain private data.</p>
            <p>Do not send pairing invitations, authentication tokens, or unnecessary task content. GitHub Issues are public.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="server-note" aria-labelledby="server-heading">
          <h2 id="server-heading">Your sync server remains under your control</h2>
          <p>Aven does not operate a hosted sync service. For server access, logs, retention, backups, or credential revocation, manage your server or contact its operator.</p>
          <a href="/sync/setup/">Read the sync guide <ArrowRightIcon /></a>
        </aside>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div><Brand /></div>
        <nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><a href="/getting-started/">Docs</a><a href="/changelog/">Changelog</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/support/" aria-current="page">Get in touch</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="https://github.com/raine/aven">Source <ExternalLinkIcon /></a><a href="https://x.com/aventasksdev">X <ExternalLinkIcon /></a></nav>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
